# Local tool state
# logs/*.log is WORKING STATE (PROJ-039/T-068, reverting T-062's blanket un-ignore):
# the finalise ledger (finalise-state.log) and the unkeyed libraries.log/
# primitives.log are written to by every session in turn, so any tracked copy
# inevitably diverges between a session branch's fork point and origin/main by
# the time that session's return_to_main runs -- a real git checkout/merge
# conflict, not a hypothetical one (see sid ca95a57b, home 3ad6e62). Recovery
# guards (T-030) read the ledger straight off the working tree, so an ignored
# file changes nothing for them.
#
# The T-062 operator intent (completed session logs ride the result PR as
# durable diagnostics) is kept by different means: the finalise force-adds
# (`git add -f`) THIS session's own sid-keyed logs (libraries-{sid8}.log,
# primitives-{sid8}.log) into its result commit explicitly, before
# return_to_main runs (lib/session_guard.py stage_session_logs).
logs/*.log
.env

# Per-home-repo scoped env block (plaintext secrets until PROJ-003) — NEVER commit.
# Lives only on the workstation; carries PODZONE_QDRANT_APIKEY / SECRETCTL_PASSWORD.
# The committed .claude/settings.json carries hooks only; primitives/ + lib/ are
# resident under .claude/ (self-contained, no AGENT_TOOLING_DIR — PROJ-039 C2-v2.1).
.claude/settings.local.json
